meta {
  name: Get Total Trip Per Year
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/stats/total/trip/monthly/:year
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  year: 2026
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Total Trip Per Year
  
  This request is used to get total trip per month by given `year`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Name | Type    | Required | Description       | Example |
  |------|---------|----------|----------------------|---------|
  | year | integer | yes      | Trip created year   | 2024    |
  
  > Note: the Swagger doc for this endpoint also lists a `vehicle_id` parameter, but the URL path has no `{vehicle_id}` segment — this appears to be a doc mismatch and has been omitted here.
  
  ## Responses
  
  **200 — stats fetched**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "stats fetched",
    "data": [
      { "context": "Jan", "total": 3 }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
  ```
  
  **404 — stats failed to fetched**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "stats not found"
  }
  ```
  
  **500 — Internal Server Error**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
  ```
}
